        name: "Well-Keeper Layla Meret",
        variantType: "STEVE",
        version: "1.0.0"
    },
    data: {
        ActionData: {
            ActionEventSet: {
                ON_INTERACTION: [
                    {
                        Type: "OPEN_DEFAULT_DIALOG"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        ArmorDropChances: [0.08500000089406967f, 0.08500000089406967f, 0.08500000089406967f, 0.08500000089406967f],
        ArmorItems: [
            {},
            {},
            {},
            {}
        ],
        Brain: {
            memories: {}
        },
        CanPickUpLoot: 0b,
        CustomNameVisible: 1b,
        DialogData: {
            Type: "STANDARD",
            DialogDataSet: [
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "layla_traded"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 20,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "A fair trade",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The Sandshrew has already claimed the cool sand at the bottom of my shaft — a well needs a keeper who fits it, and I am getting too stiff for the ladder. And you walked off with the last thing my well ever raised. Feed the whiskered one mud sometimes. It is not a request, it is a recipe."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "When the Company circus is done with this town, come back and tell the well what you did with its fish. Wells keep everything you tell them. That is what they are for."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Layla — a fair exchange",
                    Label: "traded"
                },
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Trade a Sandshrew for the Whiscash",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "cobblemon-initiative trade sandshrew whiscash 50 layla_traded"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_DEFAULT_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Conditions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                                    Operation: "EQUALS",
                                    Name: "no_layla_traded"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "trade_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Not today",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "This well ran a thousand years and died in one night. But the bottom of a thousand-year well is never quite empty — something whiskered has been thumping down there since before my grandmother kept the rope. A Whiscash, fat on centuries of offerings, and it deserves better than a dead shaft."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Here is my price, and it is not coin: bring me a Sandshrew. A dry well still wants a keeper, and nothing keeps cool sand like a Sandshrew does. One digger for one whiskered old god — the fairest trade this town has seen since the Company came."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Well-Keeper Layla Meret",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
        },
